入れてほしいとリクエストしています。\n\nパスティを描くとしたら、添付の画像からヒントを得て、股間にヌードを描くのではなく、リファレンスにあるようにショーツを入れてください。\n\nその他は全てお任せします。\n\n参考資料 - https://imgur.com/a/lmktCOm\n\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Vab0118/works/36", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f573a68/uploads/origins/2d18978d-5551-4b5f-a3d4-5501860c4d0d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e525ffed8643d791d3e9da56b5524a0c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f573a68/uploads/origins/2d18978d-5551-4b5f-a3d4-5501860c4d0d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e525ffed8643d791d3e9da56b5524a0c, https://si.imgix.net/2f573a68/uploads/origins/2d18978d-5551-4b5f-a3d4-5501860c4d0d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8b5b6d7a4111a96c9105ff5703c545ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f573a68/uploads/origins/2d18978d-5551-4b5f-a3d4-5501860c4d0d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=128cdb6aaaec0314b851b756128669d9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Vab0118/works/35", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0ac4869/uploads/origins/d4601d28-4432-447b-80a2-4965af4d3cf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29229427e058084ffa7e0519622c1a00", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e0ac4869/uploads/origins/d4601d28-4432-447b-80a2-4965af4d3cf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29229427e058084ffa7e0519622c1a00, https://si.imgix.net/e0ac4869/uploads/origins/d4601d28-4432-447b-80a2-4965af4d3cf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c690cd757111521b4d00fe68cf35edb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e0ac4869/uploads/origins/d4601d28-4432-447b-80a2-4965af4d3cf3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ab13b9e75a2ff881b4c8c0c3958f1bf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "おいVab!!!私は本当にあなたの絵が好きです!私のキャラクターをあなたのメカスタイルで描いていただけませんか!ポーズや衣装の変更、ロボットのパーツの追加など、ご自由にどうぞ!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1508731317562839040", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Vab0118/works/34", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/120e474f/uploads/origins/366a5b39-15d0-492f-94ad-34953a6a77a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88dd8f47a640c21366869d21a52bdbc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/120e474f/uploads/origins/366a5b39-15d0-492f-94ad-34953a6a77a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88dd8f47a640c21366869d21a52bdbc3, https://si.imgix.net/120e474f/uploads/origins/366a5b39-15d0-492f-94ad-34953a6a77a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=084d2efb0c574eea66523ae0cbfe38c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/120e474f/uploads/origins/366a5b39-15d0-492f-94ad-34953a6a77a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8fae1f5c942e3775385249f55aab144 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Vab先生，\n\nHi! I really really love the work you drew for me. I have a another character want to have mechanical clothing design from you too. May I cooperate with you again please？\n1. For young girls, new functional clothing is required, and the design of ears and hairstyle can be changed.  \n2. Please don't use mechanical materials all over the body, and can the middle part o